WEBVTT

00:00:00.970 --> 00:00:03.720
<i>As long as good exists in this world,</i>

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.720
<i>so, too, shall evil thrive.</i>

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>Narrator</b>

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>Daisuke Tsuchiya</b>

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:09.670
<i>But behind this eternal 
clash of good and evil,</i>

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:12.500
<i>there is another battle that goes unseen.</i>

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:26.500
You have taken great pains 
to come here today.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.010
<b>Absolute Zero Chief of Staff
Megistus</b>

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:31.010
I am Chief of Staff Megistus 
of Secret Society: Agastia.

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:35.500
You have my thanks for responding to 
our classified ad for combatants.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.810
