They really exist!</b>

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:04.320
<b>Secret Society: Agastia</b>

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:04.320
<b>Combatant Interviews</b>

00:20:58.930 --> 00:21:04.330
Kindly introduce yourself and explain 
why you wish to join our company.

00:21:04.330 --> 00:21:07.420
Well, my name is Karen Mizuki.

00:21:07.420 --> 00:21:11.280
I occasionally serve as a 
combatant on a temporary basis.

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:14.190
And it's kind of...

00:21:14.190 --> 00:21:18.840
I feel like if I'm going to do this, 
I'd rather be full-time, you know?

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:20.190
I see.

00:21:20.190 --> 00:21:23.580
And what kind of evils have 
you perpetrated in the past?

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:25.230
Evils?

00:21:25.230 --> 00:21:28.060
As you well know, we are 
an evil secret society.

00:21:28.060 --> 00:21:30.100
Evil is our business.

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:32.690
What kind of evil deeds have you committed?

00:21:32.690 --> 00:21:33.900
W-Well...

00:21:33.900 --> 00:21:37.140
Are you telling me you've 
never done anything wrong?

00:21:37.140 --> 00:21:39.860
I-I certainly have!

00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:42.380
Just recently, I got yelled 
at for squeezing lemon

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:44.610
Why are you putting lemon on it?! 
I don't like lemon on my kara-age!

00:21:42.260 --> 00:21:44.610
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:21:42.380 --> 00:21:44.610
over an entire shared plate 
of kara-age chicken!

00:21:46.210 --> 00:21:48.560
That really is quite evil.

00:21:49.050 --> 00:21:50.120
Anything else?

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:52.210
I always play the free version of games!

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:54.250
That's not particularly evil.

00:21:54.810 --> 00:21:56.700
When there's an event coming up in a game,

00:21:56.700 --> 00:21:59.750
I lie to avoid getting shifts at work.

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:03.020
That's better than taking the 
shifts and then skipping.

00:22:03.020 --> 00:22:05.020
I've also counterfeited money.

00:22:05.020 --> 00:22:07.340
That's a serious crime!

00:22:07.340 --> 00:22:08.500
How much?

00:22:08.760 --> 00:22:10.760
A single 100 million yen bill.

00:22:14.970 --> 00:22:16.770
Any further evil deeds?

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:19.760
Well... let me see.

00:22:20.180 --> 00:22:24.650
The truth is... I can't 
do much at all on my own.

00:22:27.140 --> 00:22:29.000
I'm totally useless.

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:31.440
And I can't help anyone...

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:34.500
So all I do is cause trouble.

00:22:35.060 --> 00:22:38.390
Nobody needs me, so...

00:22:46.280 --> 00:22:48.440
Hey, there you are!

00:22:48.610 --> 00:22:50.160
Miss Matsuyama?!

00:22:50.160 --> 00:22:52.790
I told you we had a job, Mizuki!

00:22:52.790 --> 00:22:54.940
What're you doing here?

00:22:54.940 --> 00:22:56.360
Well... I...

00:22:56.360 --> 00:22:57.420
Let's go!

00:22:57.420 --> 00:23:00.860
The job's early in the morning and far away, 
so we've gotta head out tonight.

00:23:01.180 --> 00:23:05.180
But I'm so useless. 
I'll only get in your way.

00:23:05.180 --> 00:23:06.750
What are you talking about?

00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:08.940
We need you there, Mizuki!

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:10.200
Let's go.

00:23:10.790 --> 00:23:12.180
Are you... sure?

00:23:14.190 --> 00:23:16.190
We're going now.

00:23:16.190 --> 00:23:17.460
We've gotta hurry!

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:18.690
C'mon, run!

00:23:19.140 --> 00:23:21.180
W-Wait!

00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:26.290
Next, please!

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:28.260
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:27.320 --> 00:23:28.770
Next time, Episode 9:

00:23:28.260 --> 00:23:32.000
<b>The Rotting but Heroic Figures
of Ancient Souls of the Dead that
Congregate in the Abyss Find a
Ray of Hope in the Darkness from
 Pride Pulled from Another Time</b>

00:23:28.770 --> 00:23:32.020
"The Rotting but Heroic Figures 
yada yada Another Time"!
